      "code": "#include \"driver/gpio.h\"\n\ngpio_reset_pin(GPIO_NUM_2);    /* clears any leftover mux setting */\ngpio_set_direction(GPIO_NUM_2, GPIO_MODE_OUTPUT);\ngpio_set_level(GPIO_NUM_2, 1);\n\ngpio_config_t in = {\n    .pin_bit_mask = 1ULL << GPIO_NUM_4,\n    .mode         = GPIO_MODE_INPUT,\n    .pull_up_en   = GPIO_PULLUP_ENABLE,\n    .intr_type    = GPIO_INTR_NEGEDGE,\n};\ngpio_config(&in);",
      "gotcha": "pin_bit_mask is 64-bit. Writing 1 << GPIO_NUM_34 instead of 1ULL << overflows a 32-bit int and silently configures nothing."
